{"notice_id":47358626,"sections":[{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0000","values":[{"field_id":"BT-115-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"BT-131(d)-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2026-10-19T14:00:00+02:00"},{"field_id":"BT-132(d)-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2026-10-19T14:00:00+02:00"},{"field_id":"BT-133-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Digital"},{"field_id":"BT-134-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Bieter sind zur Submission nicht zugelassen."},{"field_id":"BT-137-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0000"},{"code":"allowed","field_id":"BT-17-Lot","list":"esubmission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-18-Lot","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"https://www.tender24.de"},{"field_id":"BT-21-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Neubau Biophotonik-Gebäude - VE 4710 VE-Wasseranlage"},{"field_id":"BT-22-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"LOT-0000"},{"code":"works","field_id":"BT-23-Lot","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-24-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Der Neubau eines Biophotonik-Gebäudes am Standort Leibniz-IPHT, Campus Beutenberg in Jena, dient vorwiegend der Unterbringung von Laborflächen der biologischen Sicherheitsstufen S2/S3**, von Büroflächen sowie eines Konfernzbereiches. Die Hauptnutzung umfasst Forschung und Entwicklung optischer Gesundheitstechnologien. Für die Ausführung der ausgeschriebenen Leistung sind folgende Mengen/ Nachweise vorgesehen: \n\n-Anschluss an Bestandsanlage\n-UV-Desinfektion 3,5³/h\n-Gesamtlänge Rohrleitung ca. 475 m\n-Material Rohrleitung/Tank/Armaturen PP-H\n-Tagesverbrauch 1,4 m3\n-Spitzenverbrauch 1,9 m³/h\n-VE-Wassertank 4 m3\n-VE-Wasserpumpen 2x3,5m³/h"},{"code":"45232430","field_id":"BT-262-Lot","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"BT-536-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2026-12-02"},{"field_id":"BT-537-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2028-02-15"},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-63-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-726-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"no","field_id":"BT-736-Lot","list":"reserved-execution","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"allowed","field_id":"BT-743-Lot","list":"einvoicing","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-764-Lot","list":"ecatalog-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"allowed","field_id":"BT-769-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"late-all","field_id":"BT-771-Lot","list":"missing-info-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Fehlende Unterlagen, welche auf Verlangen nachzureichen sind, können von der Vergabestelle mit einer Frist von 6 Kalendertagen nachgefordert werden."},{"code":"not-requ","field_id":"BT-79-Lot","list":"requirement-stage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-810-Lot","list":"eed-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-94-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"BT-98-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"DAY","value":60.0},{"field_id":"BT-99-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Ein Nachprüfungsantrag ist unzulässig, soweit der Antrag erst nach Zuschlagserteilung zugestellt wird (§ 168 Abs. 2 Satz 1 GWB). Die Zuschlagserteilung ist möglich 10 Tage nach Absendung der Bekanntgabe der Vergabeentscheidung per Fax oder per E-Mail bzw. 15 Tage nach Absendung der Bekanntgabe der Vergabeentscheidung per Post (§ 134 GWB). Die Zulässigkeit eines Nachprüfungsantrags setzt ferner voraus, dass die geltend gemachten Vergabeverstöße innerhalb von 10 Tagen nach Kenntnis bzw. - soweit die Vergabeverstöße aus der Bekanntmachung oder den Vergabeunterlagen erkennbar sind - bis zum Ablauf der Teilnahme- bzw. Angebotsfrist gerügt wurden (§ 160 Abs. 3 S. 1 Nr. 1 bis 3 GWB). Ein 637472-2025 Page 4/5 8.1. 8.1. 8.1. 8.1. Nachprüfungsantrag ist ebenfalls unzulässig, soweit mehr als 15 Kalendertage nach Eingang der Mitteilung des Auftraggebers, einer Rüge nicht abhelfen zu wollen, vergangen sind (§ 160 Abs. 3 S. 1 Nr. 4 GWB). Des Weiteren wird auf die in § 135 Abs. 2 GWB genannten Fristen verwiesen."},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-7005"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-7004"},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicOrderUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicPaymentUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1}]},{"kind":"Change","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-Change#0","values":[]},{"kind":"ChangedSection","parent_section_id":"ND-Change#0","section_id":"ND-ChangedSection#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-13716-notice","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"LOT-0000"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-7001","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#0","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"Jena"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_section_id":"ORG-7004","section_id":"ND-CompanyLegalEntity#1","values":[{"field_id":"BT-501-Organization-Company","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"Weimar"}]},{"kind":"CompanyLegalEntity","parent_s